{"4605940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DEMON'S REIGN", "steam_appid": 4605940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>'The world has entered a dark age. Demons reign over the realm of men, enslaving them and siphoning their life essence. You, the lost warrior, have been once again brought to life to fight the demonic scourge and bring light back to the world.'</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4605940/extras/f143a8bfcd384a763663ab49413ed6de.webp?t=1780587173\" width=488 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world of dark fantasy, where demons seek the occult power of the<strong> Great Eternal Dragon</strong>, you, the<strong> lost warrior</strong>, must seek strength and slay the archdemons to bring light to the world once again.<br><br><strong>Demon's Reign</strong> is an RPG set in the medieval world of<strong> Dungeon Mori</strong>, in a distant past lost to the ages. With great emphasis on exploration inspired by the original<i> Soulslike </i>games, you can choose your own path of progression through the game and freely build your character's playstyle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4605940/extras/4ec1c9047c23364c0a74c2e292b23b48.webp?t=1780587173\" width=488 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a plethora of different items, freely build your character to tackle each challenge that presents itself to you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be a<i> sword wielding knight</i>, a<i> powerful spellcasting mage</i>,<i> </i>a<i> cunning and agile thief</i>, or a<i> holy cleric on a noble mission</i>. Wield any equipment you find to suit your preferred playstyle and defeat the menacing bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4605940/extras/adef829ba357228f8656cbc5e84ba74d.webp?t=1780587173\" width=488 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With six major areas divided in many sections inside, explore them at whatever order you wish, with increasingly challenging enemies and levels as you advance through them.  <br><br>Seek hidden, powerful artifacts that can either help you through your struggles, or elevate your powers beyond measure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4605940/extras/3c4e1aeee9a7ec32b035213011def2d4.webp?t=1780587173\" width=488 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each area's section containing a boss at the end, face the challenge of the <i>Archdemons</i> and claim their power for yourself. Overcome impossible challenges and grow from a lost soul to a powerful warrior.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can you restore the light of a world veiled by darkness? Do you have what it takes to defeat... or claim, the power of the archdemons? Face the challenge and find out!</h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>'The world has entered a dark age. Demons reign over the realm of men, enslaving them and siphoning their life essence. You, the lost warrior, have been once again brought to life to fight the demonic scourge and bring light back to the world.'</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4605940/extras/f143a8bfcd384a763663ab49413ed6de.webp?t=1780587173\" width=488 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world of dark fantasy, where demons seek the occult power of the<strong> Great Eternal Dragon</strong>, you, the<strong> lost warrior</strong>, must seek strength and slay the archdemons to bring light to the world once again.<br><br><strong>Demon's Reign</strong> is an RPG set in the medieval world of<strong> Dungeon Mori</strong>, in a distant past lost to the ages. With great emphasis on exploration inspired by the original<i> Soulslike </i>games, you can choose your own path of progression through the game and freely build your character's playstyle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4605940/extras/4ec1c9047c23364c0a74c2e292b23b48.webp?t=1780587173\" width=488 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a plethora of different items, freely build your character to tackle each challenge that presents itself to you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be a<i> sword wielding knight</i>, a<i> powerful spellcasting mage</i>,<i> </i>a<i> cunning and agile thief</i>, or a<i> holy cleric on a noble mission</i>. Wield any equipment you find to suit your preferred playstyle and defeat the menacing bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4605940/extras/adef829ba357228f8656cbc5e84ba74d.webp?t=1780587173\" width=488 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With six major areas divided in many sections inside, explore them at whatever order you wish, with increasingly challenging enemies and levels as you advance through them.  <br><br>Seek hidden, powerful artifacts that can either help you through your struggles, or elevate your powers beyond measure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4605940/extras/3c4e1aeee9a7ec32b035213011def2d4.webp?t=1780587173\" width=488 height=4